\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"media\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原始数据库快照\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"须可查询可导出\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment_fx_records\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"价格质疑的资金流证据\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"origin_certificate_bom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原产地核查与退证查询\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bonded_goods_ledger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"监管期限内及其后3年\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"must_support_offline_query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"must_preserve_original_media\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"foreign_documents_need_translation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个配置里有两条设计约束值得单独说明。<code>must_support_offline_query</code> 对应「按要求开放系统」的要求——如果系统在稽查发生时因为人员离职、密码丢失、服务下线而无法查询，企业仍然构成拒绝或拖延提供资料。<code>must_preserve_original_media</code> 对应电子数据复制件的注明要求：只保留导出报表而不保留原始载体，会让复制件无法说明来源，证据效力大打折扣。</p>\n<p>保管期限按业务性质分档，而不是一刀切五年，是因为保税与减免税货物的监管链条本身更长，监管期限内及其后三年可以超出五年。把这条规则硬编码进数据生命周期策略，比写进员工手册更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>配合与调整是稽查中最可控的部分——规则明确、动作具体，做与不做都能被记录。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>配合义务是法定义务而非协商事项</strong>：拒绝、拖延、隐瞒、系统不开放各有明确罚则，处罚对象同时包括企业（2 万至 10 万元）与直接责任人（5 千至 5 万元）。</li>\n<li><strong>中文译本是硬要求</strong>，外文合同未提供译本会在记录中留下不配合痕迹。</li>\n<li><strong>合法权利主张与不配合性质不同</strong>：要求出示稽查证、申请回避、核对询问笔录都应当以书面方式提出并留痕。</li>\n<li><strong>补征与追征的区分决定三个后果</strong>：追溯期、是否进入处罚、会计归类，做错会引发后续问题。</li>\n<li><strong>罚款与税款必须分科目处理</strong>，归类纠正必须同步更新主数据，否则错误会在三年窗口内累积。</li>\n<li><strong>是否已收到稽查通知决定主动披露是否还可行</strong>，这是处置流程的第一个分支点。</li>\n<li><strong>单证保管要按业务性质分档并支持原始载体查询</strong>，否则「有资料」在稽查时可能等同于「没有资料」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"企业配合流程与账务单证调整","id":"企业配合流程与账务单证调整"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"配合义务的四组动作","id":"配合义务的四组动作"},{"level":3,"text":"资料提供与中文译本","id":"资料提供与中文译本"},{"level":3,"text":"电子数据与系统开放","id":"电子数据与系统开放"},{"level":3,"text":"现场、询问与第三方","id":"现场-询问与第三方"},{"level":3,"text":"配合的边界","id":"配合的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"账务调整：从稽查结论到会计分录","id":"账务调整-从稽查结论到会计分录"},{"level":3,"text":"补征与追征的区分","id":"补征与追征的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"科目处理与上游传导","id":"科目处理与上游传导"},{"level":2,"text":"从差异到处置的决策流程","id":"从差异到处置的决策流程"},{"level":2,"text":"单证保管：三年窗口的工程化实现","id":"单证保管-三年窗口的工程化实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价格、归类、原产地申报质疑的稽查应答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-audit-smuggling-enforcement/customs-postaudit-process/price-classification-origin-challenge"},"next":{"title":"申报不实的构成与罚则五档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-audit-smuggling-enforcement/administrative-violation/inaccurate-declaration-violation"}}